      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    face_value = 1000\n    annual_coupon_rate = 0.06\n    market_price = 950\n    periods = 20\n    coupon_payment = face_value * annual_coupon_rate / 2\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    def bond_price(annual_yield):\n        semiannual_yield = annual_yield / 2\n        coupon_pv = sum(\n            coupon_payment / (1 + semiannual_yield) ** period\n            for period in range(1, periods + 1)\n        )\n        face_value_pv = face_value / (1 + semiannual_yield) ** periods\n        return coupon_pv + face_value_pv\n\n    lower_yield = 0.0\n    upper_yield = 1.0\n\n    for _ in range(100):\n        estimated_yield = (lower_yield + upper_yield) / 2\n        if bond_price(estimated_yield) > market_price:\n            lower_yield = estimated_yield\n        else:\n            upper_yield = estimated_yield\n\n    ytm_percentage = round(((lower_yield + upper_yield) / 2) * 100, 2)\n\n    # return answer\n    return ytm_percentage\n```",
